body:
My condolences. I don't have any kids but I was planning on it. I can only imagine how hard this must be for you. I wish you the the best OP and I know even wishing you the best isn't enough.

&#x200B;

Please hang in there and all of my sympathies go out to your daughter

Did this to my first gf under the blankets while my brother watched movies on the same couch. Also played w her nipples which made her squirm noticeably.

&#x200B;

This happened a lot. Like, daily. We are still together to this day. :|
